Note on game-derived data: this toolkit's reverse-engineered code and format
documentation are original work covered by the license above. Some shipped
data tables (notably reg_dump.json and portions of the hash dictionaries)
contain identifier strings and UI captions extracted from the game
"Watchmen: The End Is Nigh" for interoperability purposes; those remain the
property of their respective rights holders and are not relicensed here. The
toolkit ships no game assets — it only reads data you extract from your own
copy of the game.
